WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.610
Hello, and welcome to your second drink of Survivor Man.

2
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.970
This episode, written by Steve Carell,

3
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.750
has Michael going out into the woods

4
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.310
and Jim planning birthdays in the office.

5
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.710
And Angela, this was also the episode

6
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.810
where you revealed that you have a summer birthday

7
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.950
that never got celebrated.

8
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.690
I know, and I'm really like to see about it.

9
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:28.270
Well, we got so much mail from people who related to this,

10
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:30.730
and we've talked about this on the podcast before.

11
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:35.990
You got inundated with birthday cards that year for your birthday.

12
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:38.310
I mean, our mailbox was full.

13
00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.170
Yeah, I was so moved by it.

14
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.270
I had no idea people would latch on to this.

15
00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:44.630
I have a stack of them I saved.

16
00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:45.650
It was really sweet.

17
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:46.550
People were like,

18
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.750
we will never let Angela's birthday go uncelebrated again.

19
00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.310
And there were cards with donuts on them

20
00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.670
and like hummingbirds,

21
00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.230
like all the things that you guys have heard me talk about.

22
00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.010
It was really great.

23
00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.910
And I have to say,

24
00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:01.870
you guys were like,

25
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:02.790
Ange, that's it.

26
00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:04.830
We do birthdays on Office Ladies.

27
00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.330
We're never going to let one pass.

28
00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.970
We have celebrated your birthday every year ever since.

29
00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:09.850
All of our birthdays.

30
00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:10.230
Yes.

31
00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:11.670
Well, we also got a lot of mail

32
00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.030
about the birthday storyline in this episode.

33
00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.150
Brian G.

34
00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:16.170
wrote in and said,

35
00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.290
Hi, you gals are pretty cool.

36
00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:19.690
Thanks, Brian.

37
00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:21.470
Anyways, in Survivorman,

38
00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.170
Angela says that for birthday month,

39
00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:24.710
