49
00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.650
And Allie G., Nora C.,

50
00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:44.070
Will T.

51
00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:44.830
and Laura S.

52
00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:46.310
