58
00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:54.950
Yeah, I agree.

59
00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:55.950
Because yes,

60
00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.110
if Michael was looking for someone's birthday

61
00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.550
and if Creed, Oscar, and Meredith's birthday

62
00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.110
