65
00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.910
Wouldn't Creed or Oscar's birthday be up next, right?

66
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.370
That's what they're saying.

67
00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:12.850
Yeah.

68
00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:13.350
Yeah.

69
00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:14.690
Well, Caroline C.

70
00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:15.110
