2056
00:59:31.940 --> 00:59:33.460
Oh, this is such a good scene.

2057
00:59:33.600 --> 00:59:34.820
It's so good.

2058
00:59:34.960 --> 00:59:40.480
And you see in Jim's eyes, oh, my God, Michael, I get it.

2059
00:59:40.740 --> 00:59:43.120
Yeah, he has a talking head where he says,

2060
