2066
01:00:06.140 --> 01:00:08.340
Jenna, am I the Toby?

2067
01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:10.520
Of this moment today?

2068
01:00:11.360 --> 01:00:13.080
No, am I the Toby?

2069
01:00:13.380 --> 01:00:17.400
Am I like, I know it's not my birthday, but I want to be included.

2070
01:00:18.600 --> 01:00:20.180
Am I the Toby?

2071
01:00:20.700 --> 01:00:25.520
Well, you're not asking us to throw you a party on someone else's birthday.

2072
01:00:25.820 --> 01:00:32.740
You're just saying this year, don't skip my effing birthday just because it's in the summer.

2073
01:00:33.940 --> 01:00:35.760
I think it's very different.

2074
01:00:35.760 --> 01:00:36.800
Thank you.

2075
01:00:37.500 --> 01:00:40.640
Jim agrees to just add Toby to the mix.

2076
01:00:40.880 --> 01:00:42.460
