01:00:59.760 --> 01:01:01.440
And Pam's like, five minutes.

2084
01:01:01.700 --> 01:01:04.120
And he's like, yes, conference room, five minutes.

2085
01:01:04.620 --> 01:01:08.380
And he's like, no, I mean, no, we're going to deal with this right here.

2086
01:01:08.820 --> 01:01:10.680
