2090
01:01:17.780 --> 01:01:20.720
I have a little background catch in this scene as well.

2091
01:01:20.880 --> 01:01:27.780
At 17 minutes, 36 seconds, I am leaning up against Michael's doorframe, standing next to Toby.

2092
01:01:28.040 --> 01:01:31.960
And you can see the beginning of my baby belly.

2093
01:01:32.200 --> 01:01:33.480
Oh, my gosh.

2094
01:01:33.480 --> 01:01:34.580
Are you serious?

2095
01:01:34.980 --> 01:01:35.800
I am serious.

2096
01:01:35.800 --> 01:01:40.580
And I rewatched this episode with my daughter and I didn't say anything to her.

2097
01:01:40.580 --> 01:01:45.640
And as she was watching it with me, we got to the scene and she said, mom, is this when

2098
01:01:45.640 --> 01:01:47.040
you were pregnant with me?

2099
01:01:47.160 --> 01:01:48.720
And I said, it was.

2100
01:01:49.060 --> 01:01:49.660
Look, Jenna.

2101
01:01:50.580 --> 01:01:51.820
Oh, my gosh.

2102
01:01:52.100 --> 01:01:56.440
And you have your hands in front of your stomach to kind of try to hide it.

2103
01:01:56.540 --> 01:02:00.600
But Ange, I thought I could kind of see it earlier in the episode when you have your

2104
01:02:00.600 --> 01:02:02.560
first scene walking up to Jim's desk.

2105
01:02:02.800 --> 01:02:03.040
Really?

2106
01:02:03.320 --> 01:02:06.580
They tried to position you a little bit behind his computer screen.

2107
01:02:06.580 --> 01:02:11.260
But maybe because I know I felt like I had a belly spot.

2108
01:02:11.520 --> 01:02:16.080
Well, this will be the beginning of the belly tracking because we had to get really creative

2109
01:02:16.080 --> 01:02:17.440
over the next few weeks.

2110
01:02:17.720 --> 01:02:20.840
I'm ready to head back out to the forest, Angela.

2111
01:02:21.400 --> 01:02:21.860
OK.

2112
01:02:22.360 --> 01:02:26.800
Because I have a lot to say about this scene where Michael finds some mushrooms growing

2113
01:02:26.800 --> 01:02:29.700
under a tree and he starts to eat them.

2114
01:02:29.700 --> 01:02:33.820
And Dwight tackles him and forces them out of his mouth.

2115
01:02:34.520 --> 01:02:35.820
It's pretty amazing.

2116
01:02:36.120 --> 01:02:36.900
It's so great.

2117
01:02:37.180 --> 01:02:39.320
I had to know more about these mushrooMs.

2118
01:02:39.660 --> 01:02:40.760
What'd you find out?

2119
01:02:41.200 --> 01:02:47.300
According to Dunderpedia, the species of mushroom that Michael was about to eat are called

2120
01:02:48.640 --> 01:02:49.840
Hyphaloma fasciculare.

2121
01:02:50.400 --> 01:02:52.060
I'm sure I got that wrong.

2122
01:02:52.220 --> 01:02:53.820
I would never be able to say that.

2123
01:02:54.060 --> 01:02:57.660
They are more commonly known as the clustered wood lover.

2124
01:02:58.140 --> 01:02:58.580
OK.

2125
01:02:58.580 --> 01:03:00.580
I deep dived on these mushrooMs.

2126
01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:02.360
I'm guessing they grow on wood.

2127
01:03:02.680 --> 01:03:03.680
They do.

2128
01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:10.120
It is a type of mushroom and they grow on rotten trees, stumps or trunks.

2129
01:03:10.440 --> 01:03:16.280
The taste is very bitter if you eat them raw, but they are not bitter if you cook them.

2130
01:03:16.600 --> 01:03:20.260
They are poisonous either way, cooked or raw.

2131
01:03:20.680 --> 01:03:22.540
Why would anyone cook them if they're poisonous?

2132
01:03:22.900 --> 01:03:24.900
How do we even know what they taste like?

2133
01:03:25.060 --> 01:03:26.040
I'll tell you.

2134
01:03:26.040 --> 01:03:35.220
Because a common poisoning technique would be to cook these mushrooms with non-poisonous mushrooms

2135
01:03:35.220 --> 01:03:37.160
and then feed them to your enemy.

2136
01:03:37.160 --> 01:03:42.000
And it's sort of like an undetectable way to poison someone to death.

2137
01:03:42.320 --> 01:03:43.820
So morbid.

2138
01:03:43.940 --> 01:03:45.580
So clearly this has been done.

2139
01:03:45.980 --> 01:03:46.220
Yeah.

2140
01:03:46.620 --> 01:03:50.340
Did you see the movie Phantom Thread starring Daniel Day-Lewis?

2141
01:03:50.460 --> 01:03:52.340
Because this is a plot point in the movie.

2142
01:03:52.680 --> 01:03:53.040
No.

2143
01:03:53.160 --> 01:03:56.780
