2195
01:06:30.640 --> 01:06:35.140
And Dwight has to give him this rescue sweatshirt that was in his trunk.

2196
01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:45.820
Well, Jenna, I want you to know at 18 minutes, 31 seconds, when Dwight and Michael come back and they walk in the party and Michael immediately starts hitting those high notes,

2197
01:06:45.960 --> 01:06:46.080
right?

